# Caddy reverse proxy for fb-video-downloader.
#
# Replace example.com with your real domain: Caddy then provisions and renews
# TLS certificates automatically (ACME/Let's Encrypt) — no further TLS config.
# The app container listens on 127.0.0.1:8000 (see Dockerfile); keep
# FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS on the app pointed at this proxy's address so uvicorn
# trusts only Caddy's X-Forwarded-For.

example.com {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8000
}
